SUMMARY:Deadline 16:00 EEST: Saari Residence 2028 (Kone Foundation\, Finlan
 d\; monthly grant plus housing and workspace)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 31 Mar 2027 at 16:00 EEST.\n\nSaari Residence is the Kon
 e Foundation's residency in rural southwest Finland\, applied for a year i
 n advance. Residents get housing\, a workspace and a monthly grant (EUR 2\
 ,700 to 3\,800 per month in the 2027 cycle\, depending on career stage\; 2
 028 figures not yet published).\n\nOrganisation: Kone Foundation\, Saari R
 esidence\nLocation: Mynamaki\, southwest Finland. In person.\nAward: Month
 ly grant for living\, travel and other costs\, plus accommodation and work
 space. The 2028 figure is not yet published\; the 2027 cycle paid EUR 2\,7
 00\, 3\,200 or 3\,800 per month depending on career stage. No application 
 fee.\nDuration: Individual residencies 2 months between September and Apri
 l\; group residencies early June to mid-August\n\nMore: https://koneensaat
 io.fi/en/saari-residence/residency-applicants/?utm_source=artificialnouvea
 ugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://koneensaatio.fi/en/saari-residence/residency-applicants/?utm_so
 urce=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Mynamaki\, southwest Finland. In person.
END:VEVENT
